== Special Bazaar ==
Players on an {{Gamemode|Ironman}} or {{Gamemode|Stranded}} profile have very limited use of the '''Bazaar'''. In these gamemodes, only instantly buying {{ID|Booster Cookie}}s is allowed.
{{/UI/Special Bazaar}}

== Trivia ==
* Players on {{Gamemode|Bingo}} are completely unable to use the '''Bazaar'''.
** In the first and second [[Bingo]] events, Bingo profiles were granted access to the [[#Special Bazaar|Special Bazaar]], even though Bingo players were not likely to obtain enough coins for a [[Booster Cookie]] in the limited time frame. Starting with the February 2022 event, the '''Bazaar''' was made completely unavailable to [[Bingo]] profiles. Instead, players receive {{G|30%}} more [[Skills|Skill]] experience.
** Despite being unable to use the '''Bazaar''', it still says you unlocked the '''Bazaar''' when you reach {{SBL|7}}.
* On the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], the '''Bazaar''' requires {{SBL|12}} instead of {{SBL|7}}.
* The prices being determined by player supply and demand is very similar to the effect that Scottish 18th century economist Adam Smith describes as [[WP:Invisible Hand|Invisible Hand]].
* The concept of the Bazaar may be a reference to the [https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange Grand Exchange] from Runescape.

